    "description": "The Hotel Loyalty Points History API allows users to access a comprehensive record of their accrued loyalty points across various stays at partner hotels. This endpoint facilitates the retrieval of historical loyalty points data, enabling customers to review their loyalty program engagement and benefits over time. Typically utilized by hotel guests and loyalty program managers, the API streamlines customer insights and helps improve loyalty rewards offerings. Users can efficiently track their loyalty points history for enhanced decision-making and engagement with hotel services.",
